1. Open Unity and wait for compilation.
2. Create GameObject:
   [AI_MCP_Bridge]

3. Attach:
   Assets/Scripts/Bridge/UnityBridgeAdapter.cs

4. Initial safe settings:
   logEventsOnly = true
   enablePosting = false

5. Start local server:
   Window > AI Game Developer > Start Server

6. Press Play.

7. Trigger GameModeManager.OnStatusChanged.

8. Confirm Unity Console prints structured BridgeEventData JSON.

9. Stop Play Mode.

10. Enable active posting:
    enablePosting = true

11. Test Copilot/Claude scene-context access.

12. Commit:
    git status
    git add .
    git commit -m "build: activate local unity mcp bridge server architecture and telemetry adapter"
    git push origin claude/audit-repository-configuration
